Z||000000||batboy||12-01-1999||01:02 AM||||The Batmobile webpages got a new hairdo and some makeup. Still the same ol' website, just more stuff. I added a couple dozen more photos and a bunch more Fiero links. Still kind of lame, but if you have a minute, check it out and let me know what you think. Of course you know I'm plugging this Fiero Forum in my site. One page is still under construction, but have fun.<P> <A HREF="http://sites.netscape.net/batboybain/batmobile" TARGET=_blank>http://sites.netscape.net/batboybain/batmobile</A> ||||reg||1
