Z||000002||batboy||12-01-1999||07:55 AM||||DaRKLoRD, thanks! Hey, I can't get your fancy .gif banner to animate. Did I mess it up by reducing the size? Anyway, can I get it working again? Of course my website doesn't look as good as yours, but I have my little freebie site about maxed out on server space because of all the pics. I figure I'll make up in quantity what it lacks in quality.<P>By the way, the two dozen new photos are scattered all over the website, one or two new ones to a page and I think there's about 16 pages on the Batmobile site, so you have to go look for them all. Have fun exploring.<P>Send me a cool pic of your Fiero, preferably with some foxy babe posed next to it, and I'll post it on my Forum Foto Page. Got a good pic of your awesome hotrod engine (finished or in progress)? Send it to me for the high performance page (which is still under construction). Thanks for all the support. This Forum is the greatest!||||reg||1
